>0</mn></mstyle></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∉</mo><mi>R</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>The relation is <em>not</em> an equivalence relation since it's neither reflexive nor transitive.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\" </p>\n</div></div>",
